WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Zero kara kakedashite

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Start running from the beginning,

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
Omoi dake wo dakishimete

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
with nothing but your emotions in your hands.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Sonomama kakenukete

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Just keep running...

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
Itsumo koko de mitsumeteru

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
I'm always watching you from here.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
Hajimete deatta hi no manazashi wasurenai

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
I still remember your expression the day we first met.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
Taiyou mitai ni kokoro wo terashitekureta

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
It lit up my heart like the sun.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
Asu no yukue sagashite nayandeiru nara

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
If you're anxious about where to go tomorrow,

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
Ima kimi no tame ni akari ni naritai yo

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
I want to become a beacon to you.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Zero kara tobidatte

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Start flying from the beginning.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Ima no kimi wo toki hanachi

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Let go of your current self...

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
Mugen ni habataite

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
and fly towards infinity.

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
Donna toki mo mimaru yo

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
I will always watch over you...

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
Kitto zutto tooku made

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
no matter how far you fly.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.080
Episode 27 - The Concealed Trap

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:39.660
I will never submit to you!

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:42.260
Cut!

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:44.560
Okay, let's take five!

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:48.400
Maya, do you want some juice?

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:49.550
Norie!

00:01:49.550 --> 00:01:50.850
Thank you.

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:52.830
No problem!

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:54.580
I'm your personal assistant for the day, so just tell me...

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:55.590
if you need anything.

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:07.540
Thanks for your help today, Miss Suzuko Tashiro.

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:10.890
Norie Otobe, your real name's Suzuko Tashiro.

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:13.430
You were the valedictorian of your class and you received an individual award...

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:16.480
at the National Theatrics Competition.

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:18.690
They say you're quite talented.

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:21.700
I want to know why you're befriending Maya!

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:25.230
What's wrong, Miss Mizuki?

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:26.380
Norie?

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:30.800
I wanted to become an actress, so I ran away from home!

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:31.550
You did?

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:37.320
I changed my name and my appearance so that my parents would never find me.

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:44.210
Didn't you also run away from home to become an actress?

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:45.690
Norie...

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:50.170
If you don't believe me, I won't come here again.

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:54.260
But I left without telling anyone and I don't want to go back!

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:59.880
I don't want to give up on acting. I don't want to give up on becoming an actress!

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:03.710
Please don't cry - I believe you.

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:06.070
There's no reason why you can't just stay here like before.

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:07.340
Right, Miss Mizuki?

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.730
I just don't know. She doesn't seem to be lying, but then again...

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:14.100
We're about to start the costume fitting!

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.250
This isn't good.

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:25.210
Looks like that Mizuki hag has been nosing into my background.

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:29.750
There's lots I still need to do before I'm in a position to steal Maya Kitajima's spotlight.

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:32.360
I'm going through with this.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:42.580
I'll be waiting for you in the underground parking lot - Shigeru

00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:59.320
A public announcement about being in a relationship with our Shigeru Satomi?

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:01.940
How thick are you?!

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:05.780
What are you doing?!

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:08.000
Hold it!

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:11.980
I know all of your names and I know where you all live!

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:15.260
Keep that in mind the next time you decide to lay your hands on this girl!

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:17.730
I will not allow it!

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:29.190
I heard that those girls were hanging around down here,

00:04:29.610 --> 00:04:32.180
so I was a little worried when I saw you walking down.

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:34.510
I'm sorry I made you worry.

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:37.600
I'm just glad you're not hurt.

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:41.160
Are you worried that your product might get damaged?

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:44.260
Sure. If that's how you want to see it.

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:48.790
Tosa Movie Foundation Fiftieth Anniversary Party

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.260
Ayumi!

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:52.790
Maya.

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:55.900
It's been a long time, hasn't it, Maya? Miss Ayumi.

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:02.790
Ms. Tsukikage, you're looking well.

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:06.350
Yes, it's been an age!

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:09.520
My name is Shigeru Satomi. It's nice to meet you!

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:10.850
She's going to yell at me!

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:14.010
She's going to tell me I should be focusing on my acting instead of romance!

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:17.730
You know, Maya, love is a wonderful thing.

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:22.000
Miss, allow me to introduce you to Mr. Ken Taguchi.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.920
I fall in love with him in my next piece.

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:27.870
I've been watching your show on television, Ayumi.

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:30.630
You act out your unexpected love very realistically.

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:32.130
Thank you very much.

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:40.190
I guess the type of girls in love you portray in your next pieces depend on these two men, don't they?

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:42.940
Maya? Ayumi?

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:48.210
For the two of you, no experience goes to waste.

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:51.420
In the end, all of it will be good experience for <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.080
Please don't forget that.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:57.560
All experience goes towards <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>?

00:05:57.560 --> 00:06:00.700
She's frightening. She immediately saw that I'd fallen in love...

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:03.070
for the sake of acting.

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:09.730
Fall in love and learn about everything.

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:14.030
The love of the Scarlet Angel awaits one of you!

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:18.140
That's right: the Scarlet Plum - the love of the spirit of the plum tree!

00:06:20.140 --> 00:06:22.190
What do you mean she doesn't live here?

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:25.450
I don't know any girl by the name of Kitajima.

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:28.190
We used to be in the same acting troupe!

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:31.410
We've sent her ten letters already, but I guess she's so busy,

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:34.430
she hasn't had time to reply.

00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:36.860
We have some tickets for our performance tomorrow...

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:39.170
that we want to give to her personally.

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:43.730
Hey Pops, we can just wander around the place and look for her anyway, you know...

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:48.930
Truth is, we keep this place a secret to deter fans...

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:51.220
but why don't I give her a call? Give me a moment.

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:00.440
How awful!

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:02.260
These are our letters to her!

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:03.240
Excuse me.

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:07.480
Miss Kitajima says that she doesn't know you.

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:11.260
Hello? Maya? We have a performance tomorrow and...

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:12.640
Hello?! Hello?

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:18.850
Let's go home, everyone. Maya's become a star.

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:21.270
The Maya we knew doesn't exist anymore.

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:31.300
Can I get you some juice?

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:32.600
Yes, thank you.

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:37.930
And that's when Maya Kitajima...

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:41.520
has a touching reunion with her blind mother.

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:43.400
It'll be fantastic publicity.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.880
You'd like this to happen on the opening day of <i>Shangri La</i>?

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:48.980
Yes, so until then, I want you to keep her mother ignorant.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.770
But isn't that just too cruel?

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:54.010
There's no room for sympathy in this business.

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:03.000
Where are you, Maya?

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:06.350
Have you been in another play yet?

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:08.470
I want to get out of the hospital soon...

00:08:08.470 --> 00:08:10.280
so that I can finally come and see you.

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:17.780
I'm out of medicine.

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.970
I'll have to go get some more.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:21.970
Here's your next installment.

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:30.400
As you requested, we've kept her away from the TV and the radio, but...

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:33.900
how long are we expected to keep this up?

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:37.230
It wouldn't be good timing for Maya Kitajima's mother...

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:38.710
to be in the public eye right now.

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:42.610
The President of Daito Entertainment would like you to hold on a little longer.

00:08:42.610 --> 00:08:46.050
Haru will be shocked to find out that she's been reported missing...

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:50.460
and that her daughter is now a star so famous,

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.490
that her posters are plastered all around the major cities!

00:08:57.130 --> 00:08:59.840
Doctor, Haru's gone missing!

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:04.330
Maya, I'm coming to see you!

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:08.670
I'm coming to you!

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:23.120
The Tsukikage Acting Troupe Presents:
Ash Grey Dreaming

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:23.130
I guess their performance has started.

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:26.520
Maya!

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:35.090
That's right. Dream worlds are happier than real life.

00:09:35.460 --> 00:09:37.150
I open my eyes and what do I see?

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:38.800
I'm a destitute art student!

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:41.340
They look fabulous!

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:47.420
Right now, I can't even tell what's a dream and what's reality.

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:48.920
Hey, it's Maya Kitajima!

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:50.040
Are you serious?

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:50.840
Really?!

00:09:57.540 --> 00:10:00.020
Did you come here to ruin our opening night?!

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:03.140
I'm sorry. That wasn't my intention.

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:06.040
Why don't you just leave? Don't ever come here again!

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:08.270
What do you want, Maya?

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:10.200
Did you come here to show us all that you're a celebrity now?

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:11.130
Rei.

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:14.290
You're not the girl you used to be.

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:20.760
What's going on?

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:24.860
I just wanted to see everyone again!

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:27.390
Let's go home, Maya.

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:31.830
You all live in different worlds now.

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:48.220
Hey lady, you tryin' to get yourself killed?

00:10:49.220 --> 00:10:52.870
You're blind as a bat but you're walkin' all the way to Tokyo?

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:54.810
Thank you. You're too kind.

00:10:56.620 --> 00:11:00.850
Excuse me, but do you know someone called Maya Kitajima?

00:11:00.850 --> 00:11:05.050
'Course I do. She plays that girl Satoko on TV. I watch her every week.

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:08.870
I like seein' her get one over on all the villains and adults around her.

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:10.420
Really?

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:13.790
What? You really like that girl, don't you?

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:15.560
I do.

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:24.650
Hey, you're burnin' up!

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:26.600
We gotta get you to a hospital, lady!

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:29.790
I don't want to go near a hospital!

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:32.460
Please just take me to Tokyo!

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:34.570
Hey, lady!

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:42.590
Wait up!

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:45.300
Listen, this is an emergency!

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:46.590
I've got this lady with me and she's not doin' too good.

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:50.710
She's in my truck at the moment, but can I bring her to you?

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:55.560
Wait for me, Maya.

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:21.460
Maya... I may not make it in time to see you.

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:23.950
I really liked Maya Kitajima!

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:27.160
The White Jungle

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:26.500
Yeah, she was so adorable in that movie!

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:30.260
One adult, please.

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:40.180
All right, everyone! We're closing in on the White Lands!

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:48.690
They're real! The legendary White Lands are real!

00:12:49.480 --> 00:12:51.270
How wondrous!

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:54.730
Mom, will you take me to the theme park?

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:57.160
Don't spill your soup, Maya!

00:12:57.160 --> 00:12:58.030
Yes, Mom!

00:12:58.540 --> 00:12:59.970
Mom.

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:02.860
You've grown up, haven't you?

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:06.440
If only I could see you, Maya!

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:08.370
If only I could see you.

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:23.260
I wanted to see you on stage just once.

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:29.500
But even just hearing your voice... I can tell you've become a great actress.

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:30.840
Maya...

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:34.720
I want to become an actress! I want to act!

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:41.810
Maya, I'm so sorry... that I opposed you.

00:13:41.810 --> 00:13:44.640
I'm happy you've become an actress.

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:48.950
So happy... Maya.

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:55.170
So, go then, and tell your goddess that we haven't come here...

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:58.020
to destroy your lands.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.890
What did you say, Miss Mizuki?

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:10.270
That can't be true.

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:16.630
That's not true, is it?

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:22.430
Maya, wait!

00:14:22.970 --> 00:14:23.830
It can't be true!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:25.000
It can't be true!

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:30.950
Hospital

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:29.200
She told me she was comin' to Tokyo to see her daughter.

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:32.820
She was wanderin' around the interstate and I gave her a ride...

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:34.640
and then, we started talkin' about Maya.

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:38.240
When I told her I was a huge fan, she looked really pleased.

00:14:38.240 --> 00:14:40.880
I never guessed she was her mother though.

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:46.740
Mom!

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:53.110
Mom.

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:57.340
Mom!

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:05.000
She... died? In a movie theater while listening to her daughter's voice?!

00:15:07.470 --> 00:15:10.960
Mom, you've lost so much weight.

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:15.020
I became an actress, you know.

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:18.460
I won the Best Supporting Actress Award for <i>The Miracle Worker</i>.

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:20.590
Little old me, the one who was always getting into trouble.

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:26.400
Now you can be proud of me. Proud of your own daughter, you hear?

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:28.180
I wanted you to see me acting just once.

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:31.340
And I wanted you to see me on stage! Just once!

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:32.640
I wanted to show you!

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:37.630
We have to leave soon.

00:15:37.630 --> 00:15:40.240
No! Not when I've finally got to see her again!

00:15:40.240 --> 00:15:43.290
I've only just got here! No!

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:45.090
Maya.

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:47.030
Mom!

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:49.060
"You can't listen to the words of a man like him."

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:55.650
"But Auntie, His Lordship is my father."

00:15:55.650 --> 00:16:00.280
That's right. Show your mother what kind of acting...

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:03.580
you are doing right now. Show her!

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:09.580
"My father may bluster, but he does it alone."

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:14.740
"I am but his daughter, a daughter of men, and the only thing you can ever depend on...

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:17.100
is the connection that links the hearts of men."

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:20.490
"Isn't that right, Auntie? What does one's status matter?"

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:23.460
"I love that man."

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:26.460
"That's right, I love him!"

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:33.060
You performed very well, Maya.

00:16:33.060 --> 00:16:35.320
I think your mother would have been very proud of you.

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:39.510
How did you like it, Mom?

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:41.230
This was your mother's.

00:16:55.270 --> 00:16:56.220
Yes.

00:16:57.140 --> 00:16:59.180
She's still very depressed.

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:05.040
I see. If I wasn't on location right now, I'd rush straight over.

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:08.090
Can I speak to her?

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:11.570
Maya, Mr. Satomi is calling you.

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:15.910
Don't you want to talk to him?

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:18.180
Maya.

00:17:23.340 --> 00:17:27.630
The man you secretly hired has already confessed!

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:29.220
How could you do something like this?

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:34.350
If you hadn't interfered, those two could have met before this tragedy took place!

00:17:34.350 --> 00:17:37.100
All they had was each other!

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:41.710
Yet, you kept them apart and it's all your fault...

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:45.100
that her mother is dead!

00:17:45.100 --> 00:17:48.510
I respected you.

00:17:48.510 --> 00:17:54.840
I thought you were actually a gentle and affectionate man.

00:17:55.230 --> 00:17:59.810
You should take a good look at what you've done!

00:18:06.150 --> 00:18:08.840
She hasn't eaten or slept since that day...

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:11.670
She just sits there, holding her mother's ashes.

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:15.480
And now, she won't even answer the phone when Shigeru Satomi calls - the guy she loves so much!

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:22.090
She knows all of her lines and stage directions as the lead in <i>Shangri La</i>...

00:18:22.090 --> 00:18:25.010
and yet, her heart won't let her become Lila.

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:29.430
Her grief for her mother's death has locked her heart away and that's the way it'll stay.

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:35.170
She can't become anyone other than herself, so what are you going to do about it?

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:38.030
<i>Shangri La</i> opens in a week!

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:43.790
I killed your mother, Maya.

00:18:48.030 --> 00:18:50.650
Is she going to be all right? Tomorrow's opening night!

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:53.150
She was robotic in rehearsals.

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:57.470
What are you doing? Give that back!

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:04.070
I reserved this seat specifically for your mother, so that she can watch your opening performance.

00:19:04.070 --> 00:19:05.860
She'll be watching from this seat.

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:07.750
Miss Mizuki.

00:19:09.340 --> 00:19:12.060
Mom's sitting right there.

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:14.660
Maya, these are for you!

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:20.650
I'm really looking forward to your opening performance.

00:19:20.650 --> 00:19:23.760
Mr. Purple Roses is here too!

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:26.130
Mom's sitting right there.

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:30.020
I'm going to do this, Miss Mizuki.

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:38.100
Sir, please let me go to her!

00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:42.100
She's lost the only person she ever had-her mother-in such a horrible way!

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:45.230
She's completely alone! Do you have any idea how hard it must be for her?

00:19:45.230 --> 00:19:50.190
If you really love her, then don't comfort her.

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:52.330
Just leave her alone.

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:55.670
So, her mother was locked up?

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:58.260
Oh, this is good! This gives me a way in!

00:19:58.290 --> 00:20:03.250
Shangri La

00:19:58.590 --> 00:20:00.940
It's gonna be my turn soon.

00:20:00.940 --> 00:20:03.280
The curtain has finally gone up.

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:05.870
You put in a good performance there!

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:07.250
Just keep up the good work tomorrow as well.

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:08.420
Yes, miss!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.890
Miss Mizuki, there's someone here to see you.

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:12.010
I wonder who it could be. Why don't you get changed?

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:19.420
Maya!

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:20.740
What's wrong?

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:25.270
Oh, the world of acting is so cruel and Daito's the worst of a bad bunch!

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:31.100
There's a person downstairs waiting to see you and she says...

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:34.780
that she was your mother's nurse!

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:37.170
She was?

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:41.730
She says your mother was locked up by Masumi Hayami and not allowed to leave the hospital!

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:45.710
She wasn't allowed any visitors when she was in the hospital.

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:48.410
The hospital director is deeply sorry that he allowed this to happen.

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:51.330
If he had not let Daito's Masumi Hayami bend his ear,

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:52.730
this wouldn't have happened.

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:54.590
It's despicable, isn't it?

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:58.900
I'm sorry, but we happened to overhear your conversation.

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:04.500
Locking someone's mother up for the sake of publicity is inhuman.

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:09.020
Maya, are you just going to ignore this and stand up on stage as if nothing's happened?

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:18.770
I could kill him!

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:21.030
That went well!

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:22.460
Thanks for all your help.

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:27.850
That's strange. They called for me, but there's no-one here.

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:30.290
I'm sorry I'm late... what?

00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:35.460
What's wrong, Mizuki?

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:36.420
It's the middle of the night.

00:21:36.420 --> 00:21:38.820
What do you mean Maya's missing?!

00:21:38.820 --> 00:21:45.710
Being unable to see her mother when she desired it more than anything else,

00:21:45.710 --> 00:21:49.510
and her subsequent sudden death has drastically changed Maya's fate.

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:18.080
Chikazukitai noni toozaketeshimau

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:18.080
I want to be close to you, but you're distancing yourself.

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:31.320
Dakishimetai toki wazato hanareteshimau

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:31.320
When I want to hold you, you deliberately run away.

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:44.070
Marude jishaku no N to N no you da ne

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:44.070
We're like two poles on a magnet...

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:55.190
Otagai amari nimo nisugita seikana?

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:55.190
Maybe we're too alike?

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:09.920
Motto motto sunao na hitomi de mitsureba

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:09.920
If you allow your eyes to see the truth,

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:21.510
Yodonderu izumi mo suki tooru hazusa

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:21.510
even quagmires will become crystal clear.

00:23:22.590 --> 00:23:26.060
Maya. I guess you know everything by now.

00:23:26.060 --> 00:23:33.390
You've found out about my plot and your role has been taken from you.

00:23:33.390 --> 00:23:38.150
Your heart is now locked away so tightly, you can't even bear to stand on stage.

00:23:38.150 --> 00:23:43.740
Did I snuff out your light that was shining so brilliantly?

00:23:43.740 --> 00:23:46.630
Answer me, little one!

00:23:43.910 --> 00:23:51.500
Episode 28 - The Inadequate Actress

00:23:46.630 --> 00:23:51.530
What can I do to restore your passion?!
